# CQ-003 계획관리지역에서 제1종근린생활시설 중 휴게음식점을 설치할 수 있는 단서 조항은 무엇인가?
# 결과 ?ans 노드의 라벨을 '법령명.조.항'(호 제외)으로 정규화해 정답과 집합 비교
PREFIX aip: <https://onto.go.kr/aip/>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>
PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
SELECT DISTINCT ?ans WHERE { { GRAPH ?g11 { ?ans a aip:Appendix . } GRAPH ?g12 { ?ans aip:appendixTitle ?ans_t . FILTER(CONTAINS(STR(?ans_t), "계획관리지역")) } OPTIONAL { GRAPH ?g13 { ?ans aip:articleSummary ?ans_s . } } FILTER(CONTAINS(STR(?ans_t), "휴게음식점") || CONTAINS(STR(COALESCE(?ans_s, "")), "휴게음식점")) GRAPH ?g14 { ?ansn_L (aip:hasArticle|aip:hasAppendix) ?ans . ?ansn_L aip:hierarchy ?ansn_h . FILTER(?ansn_h <= 3) } } UNION { GRAPH ?g15 { ?p a aip:Appendix . } GRAPH ?g16 { ?p aip:appendixTitle ?p_t . FILTER(CONTAINS(STR(?p_t), "계획관리지역")) } OPTIONAL { GRAPH ?g17 { ?p aip:articleSummary ?p_s . } } FILTER(CONTAINS(STR(?p_t), "휴게음식점") || CONTAINS(STR(COALESCE(?p_s, "")), "휴게음식점")) GRAPH ?g18 { ?pn_L (aip:hasArticle|aip:hasAppendix) ?p . ?pn_L aip:hierarchy ?pn_h . FILTER(?pn_h <= 3) } GRAPH ?g19 { ?p aip:relatedArticle ?ra . } GRAPH ?g20 { ?ans aip:hasUnit* ?ra . ?ans aip:unitType ?hut . FILTER(STR(?hut) = "항") } } }
